description: Go standards for the optional API
globs: services/api/**/*.go
alwaysApply: false
---

# Go

- Small packages. The handler does not own chat or model routing.
- Return a concrete error. Do not use `any` or `interface{}` when a named type fits.
- No comments. Names and test names carry the meaning.
- Table tests cover status codes and payloads.
- `gofmt` and `golangci-lint` are clean before handover.
- This service is not required for local chat. Do not put a local-only feature behind it.
